{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0001_local_embeddings_over_ollama_decision", "label": "ADR-0001: Local sentence-transformers, not Ollama", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0001-local-embeddings-over-ollama.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Keeps embeddings in-process via all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (384 dims). Ollama would add a service the demo depends on being up and warmed, with no functional payoff at this corpus size, and swapping models changes vector dimensionality \u2014 forcing an index delete and reseed. MODEL_NAME stays hardcoded as a deliberate simplicity choice; the LLM-client config seam does not generalize because embeddings.py has no equivalent SDK abstraction."}, {"label": "0001-local-embeddings-over-ollama.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0001-local-embeddings-over-ollama.md", "source_location": "L1", "_origin": "ast", "id": "docs_adr_0001_local_embeddings_over_ollama", "community": 7, "community_name": "ADR-0001: Local sentence-transformers for embeddings, not Ollama", "norm_label": "0001-local-embeddings-over-ollama.md"}, {"label": "ADR-0001: Local sentence-transformers for embeddings, not Ollama", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0001-local-embeddings-over-ollama.md", "source_location": "L1", "_origin": "ast", "id": "docs_adr_0001_local_embeddings_over_ollama_adr_0001_local_sentence_transformers_for_embeddings_not_ollama", "community": 7, "community_name": "ADR-0001: Local sentence-transformers for embeddings, not Ollama", "norm_label": "adr-0001: local sentence-transformers for embeddings, not ollama"}, {"label": "Context", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0001-local-embeddings-over-ollama.md", "source_location": "L3", "_origin": "ast", "id": "docs_adr_0001_local_embeddings_over_ollama_context", "community": 7, "community_name": "ADR-0001: Local sentence-transformers for embeddings, not Ollama", "nor